## ۲۷. به‌روزرسانی `docker-compose.yml` برای Frontend

فایل `infrastructure/docker-compose.yml` را با سرویس frontend تکمیل کنید:

```yaml
  frontend:
    build:
      context: ../frontend
      dockerfile: Dockerfile
    ports:
      - "5173:80"
    depends_on:
      - backend
```

و فایل `frontend/Dockerfile`:

```dockerfile
FROM node:20-alpine AS build
WORKDIR /app
COPY package*.json ./
RUN npm ci
COPY . .
RUN npm run build

FROM nginx:alpine
COPY --from=build /app/dist /usr/share/nginx/html
COPY nginx.conf /etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf
EXPOSE 80
```

`frontend/nginx.conf`:

```nginx
server {
  listen 80;
  root /usr/share/nginx/html;
  index index.html;

  location /api/ {
    proxy_pass http://backend:8000/;
    proxy_set_header Host $host;
  }

  location / {
    try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;
  }
}
```

